      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems better to move this temp var logic back into `refill_memcache()`, to align with the pKVM-ARM implementation: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/refs/heads/android17-6.18/arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/mm.c#626 and possibly for better reusability?",
