      "writtenOn": "2026-05-20T04:58:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The original code reads host_mc-\u003ecount as the min_pages parameter for refill_memcache(). As we will copy the host_mc to tmp_mc to access the mc, move the tmp_mc here so that the count can be read from the tmp_mc. Maybe this is not important, we can just use READ_ONCE(host_mc-\u003ecount) if we prefer having tmp_mc in refill_memcache() for better reusability?",
      "parentUuid": "de3102e6_b8c36836",
      "revId": "dc845c65ef8dc55ff4e31e5422eb28fef88e5a8f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
